<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Haiti's prime minister celebrated a police operation that killed gang chief Mathias Saintil. A Haitian gang leader wrote to the United Nations seeking mediation and warned President Bukele that violence is rising after raising a white flag. Salvadoran forces of about 2,000 are searching for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince and deny conducting airstrikes. The United Nations chief condemned a recent attack in Haiti that killed 47 people, and the UCDP reported 193 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOVGk2SEZqOHVLd19JVDM1cDB1a0N1TjRCMXJDeTJkdUxHZzd4dFJHd2syemJ3NEwtUXZBcXNSQ01tdGp0ekxwMTk5WU9Xc0d0R240SFQ4RGJ1eC1pN1dDeWtiZjlwc3V5bnlkS1J0bFpCYUpETUV3RUU0cUIyZDRieDg2TC1pN1p3VVZMTzZTRFhaZTM5NGw3ZWFnUjFrYUx4UmlvZnlMTjRFZ0Izd05YOUN0RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPSG83cVJ2TDltT2JOYkVrMFAtbDFsNjV5bUJBN3YtU0JyWkNQaGNBTVdyU0JxblEzZ1B1TVNqT3V1MmJDeWw2WWxtSGFvSGNCcl9xU01adUdaZzRkeEJjNWhxUHRMeXByMmJhOWNUX25HUGl3ampua2kzSmNXUHh3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPaXlJMTRTeE9vYmg3QTl3ZEpFWnREbkVMaTkya085ZDROY3B2eE1xRHVvUlRST3FmY2dsYUN2RHllZHQ0NTRhdmlGTVpvZGlZdjhyR3JoSE9MeWRid0o4TUs0ZE5XQUFRSnprdFNjbkNURnRqWXROQ2Z3R1ppeWYxNk1sSnJwWXRQX0dBNnVSSWNOMFdwUWhnY0xqbEpvYlIwMkl0a1lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOUkdOZEEtMTQ5NzlLdWRCRUlzdVFsWkFoR0xPOTdIV2szN1hTWmNLQTBHejRjVUI0YTU1bDJpUXdONl9VSlQtZU9iLVRTWFhEbi1RLTZuNEJGQTFxZ1JXWVBBRk43Rjl0VXJrTnF5MXNONkM2TFRYRUM3QXVqTVBOR0R0a1o4NkNsZDhUVVNYTzRkTWNvYm4yRFpEWmVfUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/